      "name": "Ateeq-ur-Raheman",
      "created_at": "2025-09-10T12:46:56.583Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’ve encountered a permissions-related issue in Frappe/ERPNext and would appreciate any input or clarification.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-480365-issue-summary-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480365-issue-summary-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/magnifying_glass_tilted_left.png?v=15\" title=\":magnifying_glass_tilted_left:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":magnifying_glass_tilted_left:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Issue Summary</h3>\n<p>When a user is assigned the <strong>Projects Manager</strong> role and is also restricted to a specific <strong>Project</strong> via <strong>User Permissions</strong>, they are unable to create a new Project. The system throws a <strong>“Not permitted”</strong> error, saying the user needs <em>create</em> permission.</p>\n<p>However, the <strong>Projects Manager</strong> role <em>already includes</em> the <strong>Create</strong> permission for the <strong>Project</strong> DocType.</p>\n<p>This issue <strong>only happens when a project restriction is applied</strong> to the user.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-480365-steps-to-reproduce-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480365-steps-to-reproduce-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/counterclockwise_arrows_button.png?v=15\" title=\":counterclockwise_arrows_button:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":counterclockwise_arrows_button:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Create a new user and assign the <strong>Projects Manager</strong> role.</li>\n<li>Add a <strong>User Permission</strong> restricting that user to a specific Project (e.g., “Project A”).</li>\n<li>Try to create a new Project as that user.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-480365-observed-result-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480365-observed-result-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/red_exclamation_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":red_exclamation_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":red_exclamation_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Observed Result</h3>\n<p>The user is blocked from creating a Project and shown a <strong>“Not permitted”</strong> error.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-480365-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480365-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Expected Behavior</h3>\n<p>Users with the <strong>Projects Manager</strong> role should be able to create new Projects, even if they are restricted to certain existing Projects — especially since they may be managing multiple.</p>\n<p>The restriction should not block creation of new records unless explicitly set to do so.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-480365-related-github-issue-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480365-related-github-issue-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/link.png?v=15\" title=\":link:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":link:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Related GitHub Issue</h3>\n<p>I’ve also documented the issue here: <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/issues/33965\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub Issue #33965</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Has anyone else encountered this or found a workaround?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0e5f2c823f13ea9574eee02317e6ed63d2c7ea1a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0e5f2c823f13ea9574eee02317e6ed63d2c7ea1a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0e5f2c823f13ea9574eee02317e6ed63d2c7ea1a.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"238ANYtIUuLecRKRNHcunfT1Kpc\" width=\"646\" height=\"279\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">646×279 23.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/c/7c97173e3860e2c7c09f73b08c864f7fb8c8c89f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7c97173e3860e2c7c09f73b08c864f7fb8c8c89f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c97173e3860e2c7c09f73b08c864f7fb8c8c89f_2_690x407.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hMaUQr63pyPwrSY3GO8vjkeXbQj\" width=\"690\" height=\"407\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c97173e3860e2c7c09f73b08c864f7fb8c8c89f_2_690x407.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c97173e3860e2c7c09f73b08c864f7fb8c8c89f_2_1035x610.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/c/7c97173e3860e2c7c09f73b08c864f7fb8c8c89f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1301×768 101 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/3/930f1da970a216c0c0fd74d4f7b0b36a37049cdc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/930f1da970a216c0c0fd74d4f7b0b36a37049cdc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/upload